  "brain_first": "“第一问：这句话已经有谓语了吗？”",
  "sort_order": 1050,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2112
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "括号给 verb，如 develop, build, attract。",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2113
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2114
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Finite verb = 真正承担句子时态/人称的谓语；",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2115
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "non-finite = doing/done/to do 等非谓语形式。",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2116
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “第一问：这句话已经有谓语了吗？”",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2117
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 这是语法填空最关键的分流。",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2118
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2119
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 找句子主干，圈已有谓语动词。",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2120
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 若没有谓语：判断时间 → 主动/被动 → 主谓一致。",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2121
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 若已有谓语且无并列连词：大概率考虑非谓语。",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2122
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 非谓语再判断逻辑主语与动作关系、时间/目的和固定结构。",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2123
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 空格前后各画一条短线；标 pronoun? / contrast? / cause? / example?；两个",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2124
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "纠结选项写 A/B 再逐条验指代与逻辑。",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2125
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2126
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 有 and/but/or 连接两个谓语 → 第二个仍可能是谓语",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2127
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 逗号不能单独连接两个完整主句 → 后一动词常需非谓语/从句",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2128
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 介词后动词通常用 -ing",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2129
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 句子主干完整，且动词形式与时间/语态/结构一致。",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2130
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 找不到谓语时先删掉从句和介词短语，只看主句“谁做什么”。",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2131
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2132
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The market, ___ (build) in the 1990s, attracts thousands of visitors.",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2133
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "主句谓语是 attracts；market 与 build 是被动关系，因此 built。",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2134
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2135
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 看到过去时间就把所有动词变过去式。",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2136
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 句子已有谓语还再放一个谓语。",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2137
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2138
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 已有谓语吗？",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2139
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 谁做动作？",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2140
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 主动/被动？",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2141
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 时间关系？",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2142
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： 7-P 代词指代｜7-L 逻辑关系｜7-T 主题链",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2143
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "｜7-O 位置不合理｜7-R 内容重复。",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2144
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 77,
      "sourceIndex": 2145
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 动词：谓语先分流，再看时间/主动被动。",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2146
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2148
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 句子已有谓语，又给动词，优先考虑？",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2149
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 无谓语动词空顺序？",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2150
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. The bridge ___ last year (build).",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2151
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. Students ___ outside are waiting. (wait)",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2152
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 目的“去那儿帮助”用？",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2153
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 非谓语/并列结构等。；2. 时间→主动被动→主谓一致。；3. was built；4. waiting；5. to help",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2154
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— GF2 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“GF2”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2155
    }
  ],
